{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45135","headline":"送陆侍御士佳赴上京 · 皎然","name":"送陆侍御士佳赴上京","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"长安三千里，喜行不言永。\n清路黄尘飞，大河沧流静。\n更怀西川府，主公昔和鼎。\n伊郁瑶瑟情，威迟花骢影。\n此时已难别，日又无停景。\n出饯阙相从，心随过前岭。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皎然","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_45135.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_45135","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}